   "status": "implemented",
   "fix": {
    "layer": "analysis-engine",
    "effort": 4,
    "how": "Mask exposed hypervisor interfaces consistently, including relocated ranges and interface signatures. Remove dependent guest enlightenments only after checking boot, clock and interrupt behavior.",
    "chimera": "The reviewed upstream cpuidmon stealth path clears leaf 1 ECX[31] and 0x40000000 through 0x40000004. Audit the deployed build for relocated Xen 0x40000100 and Viridian/Hyper-V leaves; do not assume -s covers them. Xen defines relocation in arch-x86/cpuid.h."
   },
